py\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대 상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1차 서류심사 통과자(단, 20팀이 넘을 경우에 한해)</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp; -</span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">기본적으로는 모두 발표심사를 거칠 계획이니 1차 접수를 한 팀들은&nbsp;간략하게 </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">PT준비를 해두시기 바랍니다. </span></span></p></span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;-단, 접수인원이 20팀이 넘을 경우 시간관계상 1차 서류심사 당락 여부에 따라 PT발표를 진행할&nbsp;예정입니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;-발표시간은 7분 이내로 간략하게 설명. .</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;-발표자료 형식은 자유재량,&nbsp;자료는 개별로 메모리스틱에 준비할 것.</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">□ 발표심사 순서 및 1차 합격자 공지&nbsp;: <font face=\"휴먼명조\">2012</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">목) 오전 10시 학교 홈페이지를 통해 공지</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">*부득이하게 본인의 수업시간과 겹치는 경우 발표순서 변경 요청 가능.</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">*공결제가 필요한 학생은&nbsp;이오스관 313호 (창업교육센터)에서&nbsp;신청, 수령.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">□ 문의처 : 054-478-6948(창업교육센터)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
